              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0117",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0117\nType: Kubernetes Security Check\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nCheck: Prevent binding to privileged ports\nMessage: deployment app in default namespace should not set spec.template.spec.containers.ports.containerPort to less than 1024\nLink: [KSV-0117](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0117)\nThe ports which are lower than 1024 receive and transmit various sensitive and privileged data. Allowing containers to use them can bring serious implications.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0117**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|MEDIUM|Prevent binding to privileged ports|deployment app in default namespace should not set spec.template.spec.containers.ports.containerPort to less than 1024|[KSV-0117](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0117)|\n\nThe ports which are lower than 1024 receive and transmit various sensitive and privileged data. Allowing containers to use them can bring serious implications."
              },
